  "note": "Lean bounds the low-zero sum with Jensen-window counts instead of Lemma 9.1.4; its constant is about 12 times (9.29) at qT₀ = 10⁸. For t²e^{−t²/2}, (9.29) evaluates to (9.57)'s 1.22, 5.056, 1.423, 37.19."
